[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12100100_02_0010","text":"本来说好在美食广场做完的作业，\n所有人都没做完，但是"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12100100_02_0020","text":"……这个抓娃娃机，\n夹子的力道也太弱了吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12100100_02_0030","text":"别用夹的\n用勾的试试～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12100100_02_0040","text":"我也来玩"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12100100_02_0050","text":"……OK，过"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12100100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12100100_02_0060","text":"——去吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12100100_02_0070","text":"加，加油……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12100100_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12100100_02_0080","text":"不过，再休息一会儿"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12100100_02_0090","text":"等嘴里那颗甜甜的糖果化掉为止"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12100100_02_0100","text":"啊——……／啊啊……／啊——……！／啊～"}]
